# MODULE 4: DOCTOR APPOINTMENT AND HEALTHCARE COORDINATION

### 15. Intelligent Doctor Appointment Booking

This should be one of SENIORA's most important features.

Build an appointment coordination agent.

The AI should understand requests such as:

"I have been experiencing knee pain. I think I need to see a doctor."

